-- Masked multiply, corrected (spec §7): doubling merchants' gold. Twin of 021-masked-multiply.bqn. (was s07-masked-multiply)
-- Six purses, with the merchants doubled. The fixture checks that off-mask values remain unchanged.
-- The factor column is 1+merchant (multiplicative identity 1 off-mask); the .bqn's wrong half (2×merchant, wipes off-mask) and the k=3 form are BQN-only witnesses unreachable from ano semantics.
--! registry ../registries/021-masked-multiply.reg
--! expect gold = 100 400 300 400 1000 600

Merchant , Gold *= 2
